Wet 50% (est.)"], ["Reverb / Type", "Hall, Dry/Wet 30% (est.)"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Analog Feel", "30 (est.)"], ["Voice / Warm Mode", "On"], ["Voice / Stereo Width", "100 (est.)"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "Hold low minor or sus chords for at least 8 seconds: the Osc 2 wavescan layer and Harmonic mutant only bloom after the 1 s envelope delays. Ride Env 4 Attack for slower or faster blooms.", "source": "https://www.bonedo.de/artikel/ashun-sound-machines-hydrasynth-sounddesign-workshop", "sourceName": "Bonedo Hydrasynth workshop: Pad"}, {"name": "Chendom Engine", "category": "Sequence", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Mode", "WaveScan"], ["Osc 1 / Wavelist", "Alweg 4, Alweg 3, Alweg 8"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "WavStack, Depth 30, Dry/Wet 50% (est.)"], ["Osc 2 / Mode", "WaveScan"], ["Osc 2 / Wavelist", "Chendom 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8"], ["Osc 3 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "0"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "100 (est.)"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Mixer / Osc1Filt", "100:0"], ["Mixer / Osc2Filt", "0:100"], ["Mixer / Osc3Filt", "0:100"], ["Mixer / Filter Routing", "Parallel"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "BP Stn12"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "8 (almost closed)"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "20 (est.)"], ["Filter 2 / Type", "LP-BP-HP"], ["Filter 2 / Cutoff", "20"], ["Filter 2 / Morph", "25"], ["Filter 2 / Resonance", "40 (est.)"], ["Filter 2 / ENV1 Amt", "+30 (est.)"], ["Filter 2 / LFO1 Amt", "+20 (est.)"], ["Env 1 / A D S R", "0 ms / 250 ms / 0 / 250 ms"], ["Env 1 / TrigSrc2", "LFO 1"], ["Env 3 / A D S R", "5 ms / 200 ms / 0 / 200 ms (est.)"], ["Env 3 / TrigSrc2", "LFO 5"], ["LFO 1 / Wave", "Step, BPM Sync, 1/16, TrigSync Single, 32 steps"], ["LFO 2 / Wave", "Step, BPM Sync, 1/16, 16 steps"], ["LFO 3 / Wave", "Saw Up, BPM Sync, 1 bar"], ["LFO 4 / Wave", "Triangle, BPM Sync, 1 bar, Phase 270° (est.)"], ["LFO 5 / Wave", "Step, BPM Sync, 1/8, 8 steps"], ["Amp / LFO2 Amt", "0"], ["Mod 1 / Env 1 → Mixer Osc3Vol", "+128"], ["Mod 2 / LFO 1 → ModMtrx Depth 1", "+64 (est.)"], ["Mod 3 / LFO 2+ → Osc 2 WaveScan", "+128"], ["Mod 4 / LFO 3 → Filter 2 Cutoff", "+20 (est.)"], ["Mod 5 / LFO 3 → Filter 2 Resonance", "+10 (est.)"], ["Mod 6 / LFO 4 → Env 1 Decay", "+40 (est.)"], ["Mod 7 / Env 3 → Mixer Osc1Vol", "+128 (est.)"], ["Mod 8 / LFO 5 → ModMtrx Depth 7", "+64 (est.)"], ["Mod 9 / LFO 5 → Osc 1 WaveScan", "+17"], ["Mod 10 / LFO 5 → Filter 1 Cutoff", "+30 (est.)"], ["Mod 11 / LFO 5 → Env 3 Attack", "-40 (est.)"], ["Mod 12 / LFO 4 → Mixer Osc1Pan", "+40 (est.)"], ["Mod 13 / Aftertouch → Filter 2 Cutoff", "+30 (est.)"], ["Mod 14 / Aftertouch → Env 1 Decay", "+30 (est.)"], ["Mod 15 / Aftertouch → Delay Dry/Wet", "+40 (est.)"], ["Pre-FX / Type", "Phaser"], ["Delay / Type", "LRCDelay, BPM Sync, 1/8, Feedback 35% (est.)"], ["Reverb / Dry/Wet", "20% (est.)"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "Draw the step LFOs yourself: LFO 1 (32 steps) mostly low with 4-6 high steps sets where the Osc 3 saw stabs land; LFO 2 (16 steps) scatters Osc 2 wave positions; LFO 5 (8 steps) sets Osc 1 accents. Run it on the DAW clock.", "play": "Hold one low note or a fifth and let the LFOs play the rhythm. Press harder for longer decays, a brighter filter and more delay.", "source": "https://www.bonedo.de/artikel/ashun-sound-machines-hydrasynth-sounddesign-workshop/2/", "sourceName": "Bonedo Hydrasynth workshop: Rhythmic"}, {"name": "Horizon Vigil", "category": "Drone", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Mode", "WaveScan"], ["Osc 1 / Wavelist", "Horizon 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "FM-Lin, Source Mod In 1 (Explorer: Osc 3), Depth 40, Dry/Wet 40% (est.)"], ["Mutant 2 / Mode", "WavStack, Depth 30, Dry/Wet 40% (est.)"], ["Osc 2 / Mode", "Single"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "SquRoo 10"], ["Osc 2 / Semi", "+16"], ["Mutant 3 / Mode", "Harmonic, Depth 33"], ["Mutant 4 / Mode", "WavStack, Depth 25, Dry/Wet 50% (est.)"], ["Osc 3 / Wave", "Horizon 1"], ["Osc 3 / Semi", "-12"], ["Osc 3 / Cents", "+5 (est.)"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "0 (Env 3 brings it in)"], ["Mixer / Osc1Filt", "100:0"], ["Mixer / Osc2Filt", "0:100"], ["Mixer / Osc3Filt", "100:0"], ["Mixer / Filter Routing", "Parallel"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Fat12"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "64"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "30 (est.)"], ["Filter 1 / Drive", "40 (est.)"], ["Filter 2 / Type", "LP-BP-HP"], ["Filter 2 / Cutoff", "64"], ["Filter 2 / Morph", "0"], ["Filter 2 / Resonance", "25 (est.)"], ["Env 2 / A S R", "8.0 s / 128 / 15.0 s (est.)"], ["Env 3 / D S R", "10.0 s / 0 / 5.0 s"], ["Env 3 / TrigSrc1", "Rbn Release (Keyboard/Deluxe; else LFO 4)"], ["Env 4 / A D S R", "9.0 s / 20.0 s / 0 / 15.0 s (est.)"], ["Env 4 / TrigSrc1", "Rbn On (Keyboard/Deluxe; else Note On)"], ["Env 5 / A S R", "20.0 s / 0 / 20.0 s, Env Loop Infinite"], ["LFO 3 / Wave + Rate", "Triangle, 0.05 Hz (est.)"], ["LFO 4 / Wave + Rate", "Triangle, 0.07 Hz (est.)"], ["Mod 1 / LFO 3 → Osc 1 WaveScan", "+64 (est.)"], ["Mod 2 / Env 5 → Osc 1 WaveScan", "+40 (est.)"], ["Mod 3 / LFO 4 → Filter 1 Cutoff", "+25 (est.)"], ["Mod 4 / Env 4 → Filter 1 Cutoff", "+40 (est.)"], ["Mod 5 / Env 4 → Filter 1 Resonance", "+20 (est.)"], ["Mod 6 / Env 3 → Mixer Osc2Vol", "+100 (est.)"], ["Mod 7 / Env 3 → Filter 2 Cutoff", "+15 (est.)"], ["Pre-FX / Type", "Chorus, preset Chorus 2"], ["Delay / Type", "BasicST, Feedback 75%, Dry/Wet 30% (est.)"], ["Reverb / Type", "Hall, Dry/Wet 30% (est.)"], ["Post-FX / Type", "Distort, Drive 30, Dry/Wet 40% (est.)"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Mono"], ["Voice / Analog Feel", "30 (est.)"], ["Voice / Warm Mode", "On"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"], ["Ribbon / Mode", "Mod Only (Keyboard/Deluxe)"]], "seq": "", "play": "Hold one low note (sustain pedal) and leave it running. On Keyboard/Deluxe, touch and release the ribbon to bring in the +16 Osc 2 layer and open Filter 1. Feed a guitar or noise into Mod In 1 to make the FM mutant follow it.", "source": "https://www.bonedo.de/artikel/ashun-sound-machines-hydrasynth-sounddesign-workshop/3/", "sourceName": "Bonedo Hydrasynth workshop: Drone"}, {"name": "Hawkins Line", "category": "Lead", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Osc 2 / Cents", "+10"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "100"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "100"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Ldr24"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "45"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "30"], ["Filter 1 / ENV1 Amt", "+40"], ["Filter 1 / LFO1 Amt", "0"], ["Env 1 / A D S R", "10 ms / 600 ms / 51 / 500 ms"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "10 ms / 600 ms / 51 (est.) / 800 ms"], ["LFO 1 / Wave + Rate", "Sine, 0.50 Hz"], ["Mod 1 / LFO 1 → Osc 1 Pitch", "+0.3"], ["Mod 2 / LFO 1 → Osc 2 Pitch", "-0.4"], ["Pre-FX / Type", "Chorus, Dry/Wet 50% (est.)"], ["Delay / Type", "BasicST, BPM Sync, 1/8 dotted, Feedback 40% (est.)"], ["Reverb / Type", "Hall, Time 4.5 s"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly (est.)"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"], ["Macro 1 / Targets", "Filter 1 Cutoff +40, Filter 1 Resonance +20 (est.)"]], "seq": "Optional: Arp on, Up/Dn, playing simple minor chords.", "play": "An 80s-horror-soundtrack saw lead. Sweep Macro 1 while it plays; try Osc 2 Semi -12 or -5 for a heavier, darker line.", "source": "https://sonalsystem.com/blogs/frequencies/tonal-drop-thursdays-asm-hydrasynth-patch-hawkins-retro-lead", "sourceName": "Sonal System: Hawkins Retro-Lead"}, {"name": "Semitone Stairwell", "category": "Sequence", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Mode", "WaveScan"], ["Osc 1 / Wavelist", "Scorpio 1-8 (est.; any 8-wave set)"], ["Osc 1 / WaveScan", "3.0 (est.)"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "PW-ASM, Depth 40, Dry/Wet 100% (est.)"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "110 (est.)"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 + 3 Vol", "0"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Ldr24 (est.)"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "50 (est.)"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "40 (est.)"], ["Filter 1 / ENV1 Amt", "+30 (est.)"], ["Filter 1 / LFO1 Amt", "0 (important)"], ["Env 1 / A D S", "0 ms / 180 ms (est.) / 0"], ["Env 1 / TrigSrc2", "LFO 2"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "0 ms / 220 ms / 20 / 150 ms (est.)"], ["Env 2 / TrigSrc2", "LFO 2"], ["LFO 1 / Wave", "Step, BPM Sync, 1/16, 8 steps, SemiLock On, Level 128"], ["LFO 2 / Wave", "Square, BPM Sync, 1/16"], ["Amp / LFO2 Amt", "0"], ["Mod 1 / LFO 1 → Osc 1 Pitch", "+128 (full)"], ["Delay / Type", "BasicST, BPM Sync, 1/8 dotted, Feedback 45%, Dry/Wet 30% (est.)"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Mono (est.)"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "LFO 1 step values in semitones (SemiLock, ±12): 0, +1, +7, 0, +3, +1, -5, +6. Phrygian with a tritone; swap +6 for +10 if it's too sour.", "play": "Hold a single note and the step LFO plays the riff, transposing with the key. LFO 2 retriggers the envelopes on every 16th so each step plucks.", "source": "https://rosetta.to/u/venustheory/exploring-the-asm-hydrasynth-a-digital-hardware-monster", "sourceName": "Venus Theory: Exploring the Hydrasynth (step LFO)"}, {"name": "Warp Lattice", "category": "Texture", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Mode", "WaveScan"], ["Osc 1 / Wavelist", "Cluster 1-8 (est.; build your own 8)"], ["Osc 1 / WaveScan", "1.0"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "PW-ASM, Depth 30, Dry/Wet 70% (est.)"], ["Mutant 1 / Warp 1-8", "alternate high/low, e.g. 100, 20, 90, 10, 110, 30, 70, 0 (est.)"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Ldr12 (est.)"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "60 (est.)"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "50 (est.)"], ["Filter 2 / Cutoff", "128 (open)"], ["Env 2 / A S R", "800 ms / 110 / 3.0 s (est.)"], ["LFO 2 / Wave + Rate", "Triangle, 0.30 Hz (est.)"], ["Amp / LFO2 Amt", "0"], ["LFO 3 / Wave + Rate", "Sine, 0.07 Hz (est.)"], ["Mod 1 / LFO 2 → Osc 1 WaveScan", "+60 (est.)"], ["Mod 2 / LFO 3 → LFO 2 Rate", "+40 (est.)"], ["Macro 1 / Targets", "Filter 1 Cutoff +50, Osc 1 WaveScan +64 (est.)"], ["Pre-FX / Type", "Chorus"], ["Delay / Type", "BasicST, Dry/Wet 25% (est.)"], ["Reverb / Type", "Hall, Time 20 s, Dry/Wet 35% (est.)"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Density + Detune", "2 / 20 (est.)"], ["Voice / Analog Feel", "40 (est.)"], ["Voice / Stereo Mode", "Random"], ["Voice / Warm Mode", "On"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "Play slow clusters and turn Macro 1 to sweep the wavetable and filter together. Slow LFO 3 further for a drift that never repeats.", "source": "https://rosetta.to/u/venustheory/exploring-the-asm-hydrasynth-a-digital-hardware-monster", "sourceName": "Venus Theory: Exploring the Hydrasynth (patch from scratch)"}, {"name": "Charon's Core, Dry", "category": "Bass", "settings": [["Start / Factory patch", "C125 Charon's Core (BASS, 2.0 single-bank numbering)"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Mono"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"], ["Filter 1 / Drive", "+20 above the stored value (est.)"], ["Filter 1 / Drive Route", "Pre"], ["Env 1 / Decay", "shorten to ~250 ms (est.)"], ["Post-FX / Type", "Distort, Dry/Wet 25% (est.)"], ["Reverb / Dry/Wet", "0%"]], "seq": "", "play": "Turns the factory bass into a dry, driven mono bass for EBM lines. Compare drive Pre and Post: Pre is grittier.", "source": "https://www.mecldata.com/download/asm/Hydrasynth_Single_Factory_Patch_Listing_2.0.pdf", "sourceName": "ASM factory patch listing 2.0"}, {"name": "Dark Skies, Worn", "category": "Pad", "settings": [["Start / Factory patch", "A077 Dark Skies (PAD)"], ["Osc 2 / BitRedux", "8 bit (est.)"], ["LFO 5 / Wave + Rate", "Random, 0.20 Hz"], ["Mod (next free slot) / LFO 5 → All Osc Pitch", "+2 (est., subtle tape drift)"], ["Pre-FX / Type", "Lo-Fi, Dry/Wet 30% (est.)"], ["Reverb / Type", "Cloud, Time 30 s"], ["Voice / Warm Mode", "On"]], "seq": "", "play": "A degraded, drifting version of the factory pad for lo-fi horror beds. Keep voicings low and sparse.", "source": "https://www.mecldata.com/download/asm/Hydrasynth_Single_Factory_Patch_Listing_2.0.pdf", "sourceName": "ASM factory patch listing 2.0"}, {"name": "Metal Worx, Rusted", "category": "Perc", "settings": [["Start / Factory patch", "C030 Metal Worx (RHYTHMIC)"], ["Post-FX / Type", "Distort, Drive 60, Tone -20, Dry/Wet 50% (est.)"], ["Reverb / Type", "Room, Dry/Wet 15%"], ["Voice / Analog Feel", "40 (est.)"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "Follows the patch's built-in rhythm; sync to the DAW clock.", "play": "Darker, dirtier metal clatter for industrial loops. Pull Tone negative until the top end stops biting.", "source": "https://www.mecldata.com/download/asm/Hydrasynth_Single_Factory_Patch_Listing_2.0.pdf", "sourceName": "ASM factory patch listing 2.0"}, {"name": "Ed Wood Reversed", "category": "Sequence", "settings": [["Start / Factory patch", "C076 Ed Wood Calling (SEQUENCE)"], ["Delay / Type", "Reverse, Dry/Wet 30% (est.)"], ["Pre-FX / Type", "Lo-Fi, Dry/Wet 40% (est.)"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "Uses the factory sequence; sync to the DAW clock.", "play": "A B-movie sequence with a reversed, crushed halo for spooky hip hop intros. Resample it and chop it on the MPC.", "source": "https://www.mecldata.com/download/asm/Hydrasynth_Single_Factory_Patch_Listing_2.0.pdf", "sourceName": "ASM factory patch listing 2.0"}, {"name": "Pulse Drill", "category": "Bass", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Square"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "PW-Orig, Depth 60, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Square"], ["Osc 2 / Cents", "+7"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "110"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "80"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Ldr24"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "30"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "25"], ["Filter 1 / ENV1 Amt", "+48"], ["Filter 1 / Keytrack", "50%"], ["Env 1 / A D S R", "0 ms / 180 ms / 0 / 60 ms"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "0 ms / 220 ms / 0 / 40 ms"], ["Amp / Vel Env", "+30"], ["LFO 3 / Wave + Rate", "Triangle, 0.60 Hz"], ["Mod 1 / LFO 3 → Mutator 1 Depth", "+25"], ["Post-FX / Type", "Compressor"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Mono"], ["Voice / Density + Detune", "2 / 50"], ["Voice / Analog Feel", "25"], ["Voice / Stereo Width", "0"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "16ths between the kicks in D minor: D1 D1 D2 D1 | D1 D1 C2 D1 | D1 D1 F1 D1 | D1 A#0 D1 D2. Accent the off-16ths with velocity.", "play": "Short, percussive PWM bass for Front 242-style machine lines. Velocity opens the amp, so the groove comes from how hard you play.", "source": "https://waveformless.blogspot.com/2009/02/rolling-your-own-synth-bass-sounds-ebm.html", "sourceName": "Built from: Waveformless EBM bass guide + KVR EBM thread"}, {"name": "Undertow Reese", "category": "Bass", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Square"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "PW-Orig, Depth 40, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Square"], ["Osc 2 / Cents", "+9"], ["Mutant 3 / Mode", "WavStack, Depth 35, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Mutant 4 / Mode", "PW-Orig, Depth 30, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "110"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "90"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Mixer / Osc1Filt", "100:0"], ["Mixer / Osc2Filt", "0:100"], ["Mixer / Filter Routing", "Parallel"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Fat24"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "48"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "15"], ["Filter 1 / ENV1 Amt", "+26"], ["Filter 2 / Type", "LP-BP-HP"], ["Filter 2 / Morph", "128 (HP)"], ["Filter 2 / Cutoff", "40"], ["Filter 2 / Resonance", "10"], ["Env 1 / A D S R", "120 ms / 900 ms / 64 / 400 ms (est.)"], ["Env 2 / A S R", "5 ms / 128 / 350 ms"], ["Amp / LFO2 Amt", "0"], ["LFO 3 / Wave", "Triangle, BPM Sync, 1/16 dotted"], ["LFO 4 / Wave", "Sine, BPM Sync, 1/2"], ["Mod 1 / LFO 3 → Mutator 1 Depth", "+18"], ["Mod 2 / LFO 4 → Mutator 4 Depth", "+14"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Mono"], ["Voice / Stereo Width", "20"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "Hold long notes (D0-A0). Osc 1 carries a clean sub through Filter 1 while the stacked, detuned Osc 2 goes through a high-passed Filter 2, so the growl never muddies the low end. Turn Filter 2 cutoff down for more snarl.", "source": "https://www.pressreader.com/australia/computer-music/20200129/282372631575765", "sourceName": "Built from: Computer Music Reese step-by-step"}, {"name": "Rivet Gun", "category": "Bass", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sine"], ["Osc 1 / Semi", "-12"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "FM-Lin, Source Sine, Ratio 2.000, Depth 50, Feedback 40%, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Mutant 2 / Mode", "WavStack, Depth 15, Dry/Wet 40%"], ["Osc 3 / Wave", "Sine"], ["Osc 3 / Semi", "-24"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "110"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "0"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "70"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP MS20"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "70"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "35"], ["Filter 1 / Drive", "50, Route Pre"], ["Filter 1 / ENV1 Amt", "+20"], ["Env 1 / A D S R", "0 ms / 300 ms / 30 / 100 ms"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "0 ms / 400 ms / 90 / 80 ms"], ["Env 3 / A D S R", "0 ms / 300 ms / 20 / 100 ms"], ["Mod 1 / Env 3 → Mutator 1 Depth", "+60"], ["Mod 2 / Velo On → Mutator 1 Feedback", "+30"], ["Post-FX / Type", "Distort, Drive 45, Tone -10, Dry/Wet 35%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Mono"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "A clanging FM attack over a sine sub. Hit harder for more feedback grind; try Ratio 1.500 or 3.000 for darker or more metallic bites.", "source": "https://www.soundonsound.com/reviews/asm-hydrasynth", "sourceName": "Built from: Sound On Sound Hydrasynth review (FM + WavStack)"}, {"name": "Scalpel Sync", "category": "Lead", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "OSC Sync, Source Osc 1, Ratio 2.000, Window 30, Depth 128, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Mutant 2 / Mode", "WavStack, Depth 12, Dry/Wet 30%"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Osc 2 / Semi", "-12"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "110"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "60"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Fat24"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "85"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "20"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "5 ms / 800 ms / 100 / 300 ms"], ["Env 3 / A D S R", "0 ms / 700 ms / 30 / 300 ms"], ["Mod 1 / Env 3 → Mutator 1 Ratio", "+60"], ["Mod 2 / ModWhl → Mutator 1 Ratio", "+40"], ["Post-FX / Type", "Distort, Drive 25, Dry/Wet 25%"], ["Delay / Type", "BasicST, BPM Sync, 1/8 dotted, Feedback 30%, Dry/Wet 20%"], ["Reverb / Type", "Plate, Dry/Wet 15%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Mono"], ["Voice / Analog Feel", "20"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "A tearing sync sweep on every note, no glide. Raise Window to soften clicks; use the mod wheel to hold it in screaming territory.", "source": "https://www.soundonsound.com/reviews/asm-hydrasynth", "sourceName": "Built from: Sound On Sound review (Sync Window/Ratio)"}, {"name": "Hornet Wire", "category": "Lead", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Square"], ["Osc 2 / Semi", "+7 (try +6)"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "110"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "70"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Mixer / Filter Routing", "Series"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "BP 3-Ler"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "72"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "95"], ["Filter 1 / Drive", "60, Route Pre"], ["Filter 1 / ENV1 Amt", "+12"], ["Filter 1 / LFO1 Amt", "+6"], ["Filter 2 / Type", "LP-BP-HP, Morph 0, Cutoff 90"], ["Env 1 / A D S R", "0 ms / 400 ms / 70 / 200 ms"], ["Env 2 / A S R", "5 ms / 128 / 200 ms"], ["LFO 1 / Wave + Rate", "Triangle, 5.50 Hz, Delay 400 ms, Fade In 800 ms"], ["Mod 1 / Aftertouch → Filter 1 Resonance", "+20"], ["Mod 2 / ModWhl → Filter 1 LFO1amt", "+30"], ["Reverb / Type", "Room, Dry/Wet 12%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Mono"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "A nasal, buzzing band-pass lead with a delayed filter wobble on held notes. Sweep cutoff between 50 and 90 until it snarls.", "source": "https://www.soundonsound.com/reviews/asm-hydrasynth", "sourceName": "Built from: Sound On Sound review (BP 3-Ler buzz)"}, {"name": "Basement Sub-Scan", "category": "Drone", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Mode", "WaveScan"], ["Osc 1 / Wavelist", "Scorpio 1-8 (est.)"], ["Osc 1 / Semi", "-36"], ["Osc 1 / Keytrack", "100%"], ["Osc 2 / Mode", "WaveScan"], ["Osc 2 / Wavelist", "Cluster 1-8 (est.)"], ["Osc 2 / Semi", "-24"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "110"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "70"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Mixer / Filter Routing", "Series"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Fat24"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "70"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "20"], ["Filter 2 / Type", "LP-BP-HP, Morph 128 (HP), Cutoff 25"], ["Env 2 / A S R", "6.0 s / 128 / 12.0 s"], ["Env 3 / A S", "0 ms / 128"], ["LFO 3 / Wave + Rate", "Triangle, 0.03 Hz"], ["LFO 4 / Wave + Rate", "Sine, 0.05 Hz"], ["Mod 1 / Env 3 → Osc 1 Pitch", "-128 (pushes below the -36 limit)"], ["Mod 2 / LFO 3 → Osc 1 WaveScan", "+64"], ["Mod 3 / LFO 4 → Osc 2 WaveScan", "+50"], ["Reverb / Type", "Cloud, Time 40 s, Dry/Wet 45%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Warm Mode", "On"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "Play mid-register notes: the oscillators run so low they become ticking, flapping pulses instead of pitch, and the high-passed Filter 2 strips the rumble. Different keys give different pulse rates.", "source": "https://www.perfectcircuit.com/signal/asm-hydrasynth-sound-design-tips", "sourceName": "Built from: Perfect Circuit Hydrasynth tips (sub-audio oscillators)"}, {"name": "Sputter Drive", "category": "Texture", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Klangor 3 (est.; any Klangor)"], ["Osc 2 / Semi + Cents", "-12 / -6"], ["Osc 3 / Wave", "Cluster 3 (est.; complex = noisier, Sine = smoother)"], ["Osc 3 / Semi", "-36"], ["Osc 3 / Keytrack", "0%"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "90"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "70"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "120"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Ldr24"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "62"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "35"], ["Filter 1 / Drive", "90, Route Pre"], ["Env 2 / A S R", "400 ms / 128 / 1.5 s"], ["Post-FX / Type", "EQ (trim the lows) (est.)"], ["Reverb / Type", "Room, Dry/Wet 20%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "Osc 3 is a fixed-rate sub-audio wave (keytrack off) feeding the filter drive, so held chords sputter and swell at the same rate on every key. Change Osc 3's wave to change the stutter.", "source": "https://www.perfectcircuit.com/signal/asm-hydrasynth-sound-design-tips", "sourceName": "Built from: Perfect Circuit Hydrasynth tips (filter overdrive)"}, {"name": "Iron Lung Kick", "category": "Perc", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sine"], ["Osc 1 / Semi", "-24"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "128"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 + 3 + Noise Vol", "0"], ["Noise / Type", "White"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Ldr24"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "90"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "0"], ["Filter 1 / Drive", "30, Route Pre"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "0 ms / 450 ms / 0 / 450 ms"], ["Env 3 / A D S R", "0 ms / 60 ms / 0 / 60 ms, DecCurve +40 (est.)"], ["Env 4 / A D S R", "0 ms / 8 ms / 0 / 8 ms"], ["Mod 1 / Env 3 → Osc 1 Pitch", "+128"], ["Mod 2 / Env 3 → All Osc Pitch", "+128 (stacks for a wider sweep, est.)"], ["Mod 3 / Env 4 → Mixer NoiseVol", "+128"], ["Post-FX / Type", "Distort, Drive 35, Dry/Wet 40%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Mono"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "Play around C2-G2 to tune it. Matching Env 2 Decay and Release keeps every hit the same length however long you hold. Raise the Post-FX drive for a distorted industrial kick.", "source": "https://csclub.uwaterloo.ca/~pbarfuss/bassdrumsynth.html", "sourceName": "Built from: Sound On Sound Synth Secrets (bass drum)"}, {"name": "Rust Snare", "category": "Perc", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Triangle"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Triangle"], ["Osc 2 / Semi + Cents", "+10 / +50"], ["Noise / Type", "White"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "80"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "60"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Mixer / Noise Vol", "110"], ["Mixer / Osc1Filt + Osc2Filt", "100:0"], ["Mixer / Noise Filt", "0:100"], ["Mixer / Filter Routing", "Parallel"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Ldr12, Cutoff 80"], ["Filter 2 / Type", "LP-BP-HP, Morph 64 (BP), Cutoff 85, Resonance 20"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "0 ms / 180 ms / 0 / 180 ms"], ["Env 3 / A D S", "0 ms / 40 ms / 0"], ["Mod 1 / Env 3 → All Osc Pitch", "+40"], ["Mod 2 / Velo On → Filter 2 Cutoff", "+25"], ["Post-FX / Type", "Distort, Drive 40, Dry/Wet 35%"], ["Reverb / Type", "Room, Dry/Wet 15%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "Two detuned triangle 'drum heads' plus band-passed noise. Play around D3; lengthen Env 2 Decay for a gated, roomy snare.", "source": "https://www.soundonsound.com/techniques/practical-snare-drum-synthesis", "sourceName": "Built from: Sound On Sound Synth Secrets (snare)"}, {"name": "Scrap Hats", "category": "Perc", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Square"], ["Osc 1 / Semi", "+24"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Square"], ["Osc 2 / Semi + Cents", "+31 / +23"], ["Ring Mod / Sources", "Osc 1 × Osc 2, RM Depth 128"], ["Noise / Type", "White"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 + 2 + 3 Vol", "0"], ["Mixer / Ring Vol", "110"], ["Mixer / Noise Vol", "70"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "HP MS20, Cutoff 95, Resonance 25, Vel Env +15"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "0 ms / 60 ms / 0 / 60 ms"], ["Mod 1 / ModWhl → Env 2 Decay", "+60 (open hat)"], ["Post-FX / Type", "Distort, Drive 20, Dry/Wet 20%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "Clangy ring-modulated hats. Raise the mod wheel to open them; different keys give different metal pitches.", "source": "https://www.soundonsound.com/synthesizers/synth-secrets?page=1", "sourceName": "Built from: Synth Secrets metallic percussion + ASM manual Ring Mod"}, {"name": "Confession Booth", "category": "Texture", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Mode", "WaveScan"], ["Osc 1 / Wavelist", "Vokz 1-8 (est.)"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Osc 2 / Semi + Cents", "-12 / -8"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "100"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "80"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "Vowel"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "40 (vowel position)"], ["Filter 1 / Control", "60"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "90"], ["Filter 1 / Vow Order", "AOUIE"], ["Filter 1 / LFO1 Amt", "+20"], ["Env 2 / A S R", "2.0 s / 110 / 5.0 s"], ["LFO 1 / Wave + Rate", "Triangle, 0.15 Hz"], ["LFO 3 / Wave + Rate", "Random, 0.30 Hz"], ["Mod 1 / LFO 3 → Osc 1 WaveScan", "+40"], ["Delay / Type", "Reverse, Dry/Wet 25%"], ["Reverb / Type", "Cloud, Time 25 s, Dry/Wet 40%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Analog Feel", "50"], ["Voice / Warm Mode", "On"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "Slow, choir-like chords drifting through vowels, with backwards whispers from the reverse delay. Turn Control to shift the formants toward a smaller or bigger 'throat'.", "source": "https://manuals.plus/polytouch/hydrasynth-deluxe-polytouch-keyboard-manual", "sourceName": "Built from: ASM manual (Vowel filter)"}, {"name": "Cassette Séance", "category": "Keys", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sine"], ["Osc 1 / BitRedux", "12 bit (est.)"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "FM-Lin, Source Sine, Ratio 1.000, Depth 30, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Triangle"], ["Osc 2 / Semi", "+12"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "110"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "40"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Fat12, Cutoff 75, Keytrack 50%"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "5 ms / 2.5 s / 40 / 600 ms"], ["Env 3 / A D S", "0 ms / 900 ms / 0"], ["LFO 5 / Wave + Rate", "Sine, 0.40 Hz"], ["Mod 1 / Env 3 → Mutator 1 Depth", "+50"], ["Mod 2 / LFO 5 → All Osc Pitch", "+3 (est., tape warble)"], ["Pre-FX / Type", "Lo-Fi, Dry/Wet 60% (est.)"], ["Post-FX / Type", "Compressor"], ["Reverb / Type", "Room, Dry/Wet 20%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Analog Feel", "60"], ["Voice / Warm Mode", "On"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "A warbly FM electric piano for spooky boom-bap. Play m7b5 and m(maj7) voicings, record them into the MPC and chop.", "source": "https://www.soundonsound.com/node/4921184?page=2", "sourceName": "Built from: Sound On Sound review p.2 (Warm Mode, Lo-Fi)"}, {"name": "Orphan Music Box", "category": "Pluck", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sine"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "FM-Lin, Source Sine, Ratio 3.500, Depth 45, Feedback 10%, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Sine"], ["Osc 2 / Semi + Cents", "+24 / +7"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "110"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "30"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Fat12, Cutoff 100"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "0 ms / 2.5 s / 0 / 2.5 s"], ["Env 3 / A D S", "0 ms / 1.2 s / 0"], ["Mod 1 / Env 3 → Mutator 1 Depth", "+40"], ["Delay / Type", "BasicST, BPM Sync, 1/4, Feedback 35%, dark Wet Tone, Dry/Wet 25%"], ["Reverb / Type", "Hall, Time 6 s, Dry/Wet 35%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "An out-of-tune, haunted music-box bell. Play high melodies on whole-tone or diminished scales; nudge Ratio off 3.500 to detune the clang further.", "source": "https://www.soundonsound.com/reviews/asm-hydrasynth", "sourceName": "Built from: Sound On Sound review (FM-Lin mutant) + ASM manual"}, {"name": "Neon Coffin", "category": "Lead", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "WavStack, Depth 30, Dry/Wet 80%"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Osc 2 / Semi", "-12"], ["Mutant 3 / Mode", "WavStack, Depth 25, Dry/Wet 70%"], ["Osc 3 / Wave", "Square"], ["Osc 3 / Semi", "-12"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "100"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "90"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "50"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Fat24"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "40"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "15"], ["Filter 1 / ENV1 Amt", "+38"], ["Filter 1 / Vel Env", "+15"], ["Env 1 / A D S R", "40 ms / 900 ms / 50 / 400 ms"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "15 ms / 1.0 s / 100 / 500 ms"], ["Pre-FX / Type", "Chorus, Dry/Wet 35%"], ["Reverb / Type", "Plate, Dry/Wet 25%"], ["Post-FX / Type", "Compressor"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Analog Feel", "30"], ["Voice / Stereo Width", "90"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "A wide supersaw brass stab for darksynth chord hits. Play short minor and sus2 stabs, and use velocity since it opens the filter.", "source": "https://manuals.plus/polytouch/hydrasynth-deluxe-polytouch-keyboard-manual", "sourceName": "Built from: ASM manual (WavStack mutant, Fat ladder)"}, {"name": "Blackwire Arp", "category": "Sequence", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Square"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "PW-Sqeez, Depth 40, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Osc 2 / Cents", "+6"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "100"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "80"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Ldr24"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "35"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "45"], ["Filter 1 / ENV1 Amt", "+40"], ["Env 1 / A D S R", "0 ms / 220 ms / 0 / 150 ms"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "0 ms / 300 ms / 0 / 200 ms"], ["LFO 3 / Wave", "Triangle, BPM Sync, 4 bars"], ["Mod 1 / LFO 3 → Filter 1 Cutoff", "+20"], ["Arp / Settings", "On, Up/Dn, 1/16, Gate 50%, Octave 2, Swing 50"], ["Delay / Type", "LRCDelay, BPM Sync, 1/8 dotted, Feedback 40%, Dry/Wet 30%"], ["Reverb / Type", "Room, Dry/Wet 20%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "Hold D-F-A-Eb (Dm with a flat 9), or D-G#-A for a tritone bite; Arp Up/Dn 1/16 over 2 octaves.", "play": "A snappy darksynth arp whose filter breathes over 4 bars. Raise Ratchet or Chance for glitchier runs.", "source": "https://www.bonedo.de/artikel/ashun-sound-machines-hydrasynth-sounddesign-workshop/2/", "sourceName": "Built from: Bonedo workshop (LRC delay) + ASM manual arp"}, {"name": "Ash Riser", "category": "FX", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "WavStack, Depth 40, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Noise / Type", "White"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "50"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 + 3 Vol", "0"], ["Mixer / Noise Vol", "110"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Ldr12"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "10"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "60"], ["Filter 1 / ENV1 Amt", "+64"], ["Env 1 / BPM Sync", "On: Attack 4 bars, Sustain 128, Release 1 bar"], ["Env 2 / A S R", "1.0 s / 128 / 2.0 s"], ["Env 3 / BPM Sync", "On: Attack 4 bars, Sustain 128"], ["Mod 1 / Env 3 → All Osc Pitch", "+128"], ["Mod 2 / Env 3 → Reverb Dry/Wet", "+40"], ["Delay / Type", "PanDelay, BPM Sync, 1/8, Feedback 50%, Dry/Wet 25%"], ["Reverb / Type", "Cloud, Time 30 s, Dry/Wet 30%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Mono"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "Hold one note for 4 bars into a drop; the noise and stacked saw climb together. Engage reverb Freeze at the peak to keep the wash after you let go.", "source": "https://www.soundonsound.com/node/4921184?page=2", "sourceName": "Built from: Sound On Sound review p.2 (Cloud reverb, Freeze)"}, {"name": "Pressure Hull", "category": "Pad", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "WavStack, Depth 28, Dry/Wet 80%"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Square"], ["Osc 2 / Semi", "-12"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "100"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "70"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Fat24, Cutoff 55, Resonance 10"], ["Env 2 / A S R", "1.5 s / 120 / 2.5 s"], ["LFO 2 / Wave", "Saw Up, BPM Sync, 1/4, TrigSync Single, Phase 0°"], ["Amp / LFO2 Amt", "+40 (est.)"], ["Reverb / Type", "Hall, Dry/Wet 25%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Stereo Width", "80"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "Run it on the DAW clock so the quarter-note duck lines up with a four-on-the-floor kick.", "play": "A pumping pad that ducks on every beat with no sidechain cable. On Keyboard/Desktop/Deluxe you can instead put a Compressor in Post-FX and key it from a kick on a Mod input.", "source": "https://www.soundonsound.com/node/4921184?page=2", "sourceName": "Built from: Sound On Sound review p.2 + ASM manual Amp/LFO 2"}, {"name": "PhazDiff Vapour", "category": "Texture", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sawtooth"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "PhazDiff, Depth 60, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Triangle"], ["Osc 2 / Semi", "+7"], ["Mutant 3 / Mode", "PhazDiff, Depth 40, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "100"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 Vol", "70"], ["Mixer / Osc 3 Vol", "0"], ["Mixer / Filter Routing", "Series"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "LP Fat12, Cutoff 85"], ["Filter 2 / Type", "LP-NO-HP, Morph 64 (Notch), Cutoff 70, Resonance 40"], ["Env 2 / A S R", "3.0 s / 128 / 8.0 s"], ["Env 3 / A D S", "6.0 s / 9.0 s / 0, Env Loop Infinite, Freerun On"], ["Env 4 / A D S", "11.0 s / 7.0 s / 0, Env Loop Infinite, Freerun On"], ["Mod 1 / Env 3 → Mutator 1 Depth", "+50"], ["Mod 2 / Env 4 → Mutator 3 Depth", "+40"], ["Mod 3 / Env 4 → Filter 2 Cutoff", "+20"], ["Reverb / Type", "Cloud, Time 20 s, Dry/Wet 45%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Poly"], ["Voice / Analog Feel", "40"], ["Voice / Random Phase", "On"], ["Voice / Warm Mode", "On"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "", "play": "Two free-running looped envelopes at unrelated lengths keep the phase-distortion timbre shifting, so it never lines up the same way twice. Hold a chord for a minute and listen.", "source": "https://www.soundonsound.com/reviews/asm-hydrasynth", "sourceName": "Built from: Sound On Sound review (Freerun envelopes) + ASM manual PhazDiff"}, {"name": "Krell Static", "category": "FX", "settings": [["Osc 1 / Wave", "Sine"], ["Mutant 1 / Mode", "FM-Lin, Source Osc 2, Ratio 1.410 (est.), Depth 40, Dry/Wet 100%"], ["Osc 2 / Wave", "Triangle"], ["Osc 2 / Semi", "+19"], ["Mixer / Osc 1 Vol", "110"], ["Mixer / Osc 2 + 3 Vol", "0"], ["Filter 1 / Type", "BP 3-Ler"], ["Filter 1 / Cutoff", "64"], ["Filter 1 / Resonance", "70"], ["Filter 1 / ENV1 Amt", "+20"], ["Filter 1 / LFO1 Amt", "0"], ["Env 1 / A D S", "0 ms / 400 ms / 0, TrigSrc2 LFO 5"], ["Env 2 / A D S R", "5 ms / 600 ms / 0 / 900 ms, TrigSrc2 LFO 5"], ["LFO 3 / Wave + Rate", "S&H, 0.70 Hz, TrigSync Off"], ["LFO 4 / Wave + Rate", "Random, 0.23 Hz, TrigSync Off"], ["LFO 5 / Wave + Rate", "Square, 0.90 Hz, TrigSync Off"], ["Mod 1 / LFO 3 → Osc 1 Pitch", "+128"], ["Mod 2 / LFO 4 → Mutator 1 Depth", "+60"], ["Mod 3 / LFO 4 → LFO 5 Rate", "+30"], ["Delay / Type", "PanDelay, 380 ms, Feedback 55%, Dry/Wet 35%"], ["Reverb / Type", "Hall, Time 8 s, Dry/Wet 40%"], ["Voice / Polyphony", "Mono"], ["Voice / Glide", "Off"]], "seq": "Self-playing: LFO 5 retriggers the envelopes while LFO 3 picks random pitches, so no arp is needed.", "play": "Hold one note with the sustain pedal and let it chatter like a 1950s sci-fi machine. LFO 5 rate sets the density; Mutant 1 depth makes the FM more alien.", "source": "https://www.perfectcircuit.com/signal/asm-hydrasynth-sound-design-tips", "sourceName": "Built from: Perfect Circuit tips (LFO envelope triggers) + Bonedo TrigSrc"}]